      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T02:04:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Devin, it\u0027s `product_specific: true` which is installing this to the product partition.\n\nSteven, consider adding `use_embedded_native_libs: true` so that the jni lib is embedded in the apk.",
